              "question": "<p>The following are four different relations about displacement, velocity and acceleration for the motion of a particle in general.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>(a)</strong></td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(v_{a v}=1 / 2\\left[v\\left(t_1\\right)+v\\left(t_2\\right)\\right]\\)</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>(b)</strong></td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(v_{{av}}={r}\\left({t}_2\\right)-{r}\\left({t}_1\\right) / {t}_2-{t}_1\\)</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>(c)</strong></td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(r=1 / 2\\left[v\\left(t_2\\right)-v\\left(t_1\\right)\\right]\\left({t}_2-{t}_1\\right)\\)</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>(d)</strong></td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\({a}_{{av}}=v\\left({t}_2\\right)-v\\left({t}_1\\right) / {t}_2-{t}_1\\)</span></td></tr></tbody></table> <p><br>The incorrect options is/are:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 10%;\">1.</td><td><strong>(a)</strong> and <strong>(d)</strong> only</td><td style=\"width: 10%;\">2.</td><td><strong>(a)</strong> and <strong>(c)</strong> only</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 10%;\">3.</td><td><strong>(b)</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>(c)</strong> only</td><td style=\"width: 10%;\">4.</td><td><strong>(a)</strong> and <strong>(b)</strong> only</td></tr></tbody></table>",
